## step 2.185: 5x8 LCD bitmap font for the dumbphone screen (HD44780-style).
## Each glyph is 8 rows, each row a 5-bit mask (bit 4 = leftmost column).
## Row 8 is the descender row (g, j, p, q, y). Unknown characters draw as blank.

